So you have:

Verified the direct cable from the laptop to the router is good;

Turned off the laptop;

Rebooted the router (forces DHCP with the ISPs server);

Then rebooted your laptop (forces DHCP with the router);

Checked for internet access; if no, check Device Manager (again.)


I know this seems like a pain in the ass, but you have to verify hardware first before software or you can waste days chasing a problem that doesn't even exist.

